  "raw_output": "{\n  \"exercis_type\": \"CEFR Englis_Placement Test\",\n  \"section_id\": 5,\n  \"section_title\": \"Reading Comprehension\",\n  \"cefr_range\": \"B2-C1\",\n  \"reading_text\": \"\\\\\nIn the bustling city of New York, where every street is a canvas for life's tapestry, there exists an unusual subculture known as 'The Ghost Hunters.' These individuals devote their lives to the study and documentation of ghostly phenomena. \\\\\nTheir methods are both scientific and spiritual, combining modern technology with traditional beliefs. They use high-tech equipment such as digital recorders, infrared cameras, and GPS devices to capture evidence of paranormal activity. \\\\\nHowever, they also embrace the ancient practices passed down through generations – from conducting rituals in sacred sites to interpreting omens and dreams. This blend of science and spirituality sets them apart from other researchers, yet it also creates challenges as they strive to balance the two worlds.\",\n  \"questions\": [\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 36,\n      \"question\": \"What is a characteristic of 'The Ghost Hunters' approach?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"They use only modern technology.\",\n        \"They rely solely on traditional beliefs.\",\n        \"They combine scientific methods with spiritual practices.\",\n        \"They focus exclusively on documenting ghost stories.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"They combine scientific methods with spiritual practices.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 37,\n      \"question\": \"Which of the following devices is NOT mentioned as used by 'The Ghost Hunters'?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"Digital recorders\",\n        \"Infrared cameras\",\n        \"GPS devices\",\n        \"Magnetic field meters\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"Magnetic field meters\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 38,\n      \"question\": \"What does the term 'tapestry' refer to in this context?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"The city of New York\",\n        \"The life experiences of ghost hunters\",\n        \"The complex network of relationships in the city\",\n        \"The collection of paranormal evidence\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"The life experiences of ghost hunters\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\n      \"question\": \"What challenge does 'The Ghost Hunters' face in their research?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"Balancing the use of technology with traditional beliefs.\",\n        \"Deciding whether to study ghost stories or real phenomena.\",\n        \"Finding a balance between science and spirituality.\",\n        \"Choosing which sacred sites to visit for rituals.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"Balancing the use of technology with traditional beliefs.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"What is the author's tone toward 'The Ghost Hunters'?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"Curious and approving.\",\n        \"Dismissive and skeptical.\",\n        \"Belligerent and critical.\",\n        \"Impassive and detached.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"Curious and approving.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
